<%# Ohm's Law result (spec issue #55, DESIGN.md §4 Hero-result + Stat grid): a surface
    card with a 5px coral left rule holding the full V/I/R/P set. The user supplies two
    quantities and the calculator solves the other two — so the two SOLVED figures are
    the headline (accent-green eyebrow, large tabular-nums), and the two GIVEN echo back
    muted with a "Given" tag, so the answer reads in the context of its inputs. `calc:`
    is a valid Calculators::OhmsLaw. %>
<% given = ohms_law_given_keys(calc) %>
<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-surface shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(150,110,80,0.12)]">
  <div class="flex gap-5 p-7">
    <span class="w-[5px] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">Solved</p>
      <%# Shared responsive stat grid (DESIGN.md §4 "Stat grid", issue #143): `.stat-grid`
          sizes each card to the canonical min width and lets the grid flow (~2 across on a
          wide panel, collapsing to 1-up when narrow). Each card is a `.stat-card`; a SOLVED
          quantity adds the `.stat-card--solved` modifier so the card surface itself signals
          the derived figure (accent tint + border), reinforcing the accent value text — never
          colour alone (DESIGN.md §6): each card also carries a visible Given/Solved tag. The
          value uses break-all so a large 6+ digit figure plus its unit never clips. Fixed
          V/I/R/P order. %>
      <dl class="mt-3 stat-grid">
        <% ohms_law_quantities.each do |q| %>
          <% solved = !given.include?(q[:key]) %>
          <div class="stat-card<%= " stat-card--solved" if solved %>">
            <dt class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-label">
              <span><%= q[:label] %> <span class="font-semibold text-faint">(<%= q[:symbol] %>)</span></span>
              <% if given.include?(q[:key]) %>
                <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-border-input px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-faint">Given</span>
              <% else %>
                <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent">Solved</span>
              <% end %>
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
              <span class="break-all text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] tabular-nums <%= solved ? "text-accent" : "text-ink" %>">
                <%= decimal_display(calc.result[q[:key]]) %>
              </span>
              <span class="shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-label"><%= q[:unit] %></span>
            </dd>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
